        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming 2 bedroom bungalow extending to c.900 sq. ft. set on beautiful private site amongst mature gardens with front and rear access to the property. The property is situated on under 0.5 acre with excellent outdoor space.\r\n\r\nConveniently located approximately 3km from Rosscarbery and 4km from Glandore and 50K to Cork Airport.  Located near stunning West Cork beaches and many coastal amenities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room, two generous sized bedrooms, kitchen, bathroom and porch.\r\n\r\nThis property offers privacy and a tranquil environment whilst a short distance to Rosscarbery."
      },
